        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, high voltage, DB, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, high voltage, DB, at grid
Distribution losses are taken from Itten, Frischknecht and Stucki (2014): LCI of Electricity Mixes and Grid.;
UUID: 3769a510-2556-306a-8ea7-3ce33d558996
This dataset describes the distribution of the railway mix in Germany and includes the low voltage network infrastructure, transmission losses and air pollutant emissions. Not included are electricity losses due to building distribution.
Location: Germany
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: GWh
Sampling: Statistics 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3769a510-2556-306a-8ea7-3ce33d558996.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
